{"id": "EUVD-2026-101251", "enisaUuid": "53922f37-9f20-3929-9d7d-cb966c363df1", "description": "Papermerge Core through 3.5.3 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the shared nodes API that allows authenticated users to share other users' documents by supplying arbitrary node UUIDs. Attackers can call POST /shared-nodes or PATCH /shared-nodes/access/{node_id} to grant themselves any role, then read, modify, or delete victims' documents and revoke existing shares.", "datePublished": "2026-10-14T14:16:59", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T17:16:11", "baseScore": 7.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/papermerge/papermerge-core/issues/1290", "https://github.com/papermerge/papermerge-core/issues/1291", "https://github.com/papermerge/papermerge-core/blob/3.5.3/papermerge/core/features/shared_nodes/router.py#L78-L150", "https://github.com/papermerge/papermerge-core/commit/0fd469102b05b5ebeb5ee39b3f73ff76991ab269", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/papermerge-core-through-3.5.3-missing-authorization-in-shared-nodes-api"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-110623", "GHSA-w6cv-8rwh-jrfj"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.5, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1f2f41d0-cb58-3007-9cdd-182b543623a1", "product": {"name": "papermerge-core", "vendor": {"name": "Papermerge"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.5.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "62734e50-3340-31e0-a863-68924a57e69f", "vendor": {"name": "Papermerge"}}], "isExploited": false}